  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YEM022N Yemen Joint Response IV</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a consortium project with 5 partners (CARE Yemen, ZOA, War Child, Save the Children, and Stichting Vluchteling-IRC), as the fourth phase of the Yemen Joint Response, under the DRA. CARE NL is the lead. Objective is to provide multi-sectoral and integrated life-saving humanitarian support to people in need, prioritising the most vulnerable, and facilitate early recovery and resilience of conflict population in Yemen, while ensuring that all activities promote equitable access to assistance for women, girls, boys, and men.</narrative>
  </description>
